<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2999450d068d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Liz Thompson, CEO of NEDA, said that “with regard to the weight loss and calorie limiting feedback issued in a chat Monday, we are concerned and are working with the technology team and the research team to investigate this further; that language is against our policies and core beliefs as an eating disorder organization." ;
