<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/38a4b4226c3d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The news came after Sharon Maxwell, a 'weight inclusive consultant' and 'fat activist' according to her Instagram bio, shared an Instagram slideshow on Monday about her experience with Tessa, saying, 'Every single thing Tessa suggested were things that led to the development of my eating disorder.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2929" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ac6ae97f996> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Sharon Maxwell is a weight-inclusive consultant and fat activist who gave Tessa a test run and received advice from the Chatbot on how to restrict her diet, count calories, and intentionally lose weight." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2943" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3bf850b48553> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The NGO's chatbot ‘Tessa’ has run into problems after an activist posted on Instagram claiming that it offered her ‘healthy eating tips’ and advised on losing weight." ;
