<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3e006a07866f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Alexis Conason, a clinical psychologist and certified eating disorder specialist, tells Yahoo Life that 'the bot was not able to really understand how to help someone struggling with an eating disorder and what could be really problematic and exacerbate the eating disorder,' because it was created as a tool for prevention." ;
