<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c2c908527c5e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "On Monday, activist Sharon Maxwell posted to Instagram, claiming that Tessa offered her advice on how to lose weight and “healthy eating tips,” recommending that she count calories, follow a 500 to 1,000 calorie deficit each day and measure her weight weekly." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2935" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c339cbd5ab92> a airo:Evidence ;
