<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c7cde9831c51> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In March, the NEDA told its six helpline employees and 200 volunteers that their roles were being replaced by Tessa just four days after it was notified of its duty to recognize its employees’ newly formed union." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2933" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c83445557671> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Alexis Conason, a psychologist specializing in eating disorders, tested Tessa by confiding that she had gained weight and was unhappy with her body." ;
