<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cae0db4609b9> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "said Dr. Ellen Fitzsimmons-Craft of Washington University School of Medicine, who created Tessa." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2938" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cca95de49b96> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "“For someone with an eating disorder, that advice is very dangerous,” says Alexis Conason, a psychologist and eating disorder specialist." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2922" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ccbb8111cfbb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The nonprofit says the dismissals were a planned move to make way for the so-called wellness chatbot named Tessa, but former staffers claim it was a union-busting maneuver." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2933" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cd43a80527ad> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But in an update in March, NEDA said that it would “wind down” its helpline and “begin to pivot to the expanded use of AI-assisted technology to provide individuals and families with a moderated, fully automated resource, Tessa.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2903" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d01b55f9976d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The chatbot, named Tessa, was launched by NEDA as a support tool when it was announced that the non-profit's helpline would be ceasing operations in March." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2939" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d092070cb511> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Both wrote that the bot, called Tessa, advised them to lose one to two pounds per week and to eat in a 500-1,000 calorie deficit." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2927" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d36512f61e00> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "As for Tessa's bad behavior, CNN reports NEDA CEO Liz Thompson blamed \"bad actors\" purposefully trying to prompt the chatbot into giving harmful or even unrelated advice to users." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2916" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d51855d9114f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Alex Conason, a psychologist who specializes in eating disorders, tells Fortune, “Imagine vulnerable people with eating disorders reaching out to a robot for support because that’s all they have available and receiving responses that further promote the eating disorder.”" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2922" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d73efa31d616> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The National Eating Disorder Association has shut down the AI chatbot after raising criticism in society." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2920" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d75d49aa5bd6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Abbie Harper, a former helpline staffer, told BBC News that days after helpline staff officially unionised, workers were told they would no longer have jobs." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2918" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/da11ae614e4c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tessa is only offline “temporarily” until it’s rid of the “bug” that triggered dieting advice for some of the 2,500 people who tried it out, NEDA CEO Liz Thompson told the Daily Dot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2933" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/de9b16ee185f> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "\"Some of these screenshots that have gone out there about the chatbot recommending dieting or restricting a certain number of calories. Of course, were never part of the chatbot that we developed or evaluated,\" said Dr. Ellen Fitzsimmons-Craft of Washington University School of Medicine, who created Tessa." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2938" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e34d2e7d2229> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Since then, she said she believes a \"bug\" or flaw has been introduced into her original design to make the algorithm function more like recent AI tools like ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2918" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e853c5defc69> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "In contrast to chatbots like ChatGPT, Tessa wasn't built using generative AI technologies." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2903" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ec666e230619> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NEDA took it down Tuesday, and leaders say they are investigating what happened." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2898" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ef2d0f450320> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "However, Tessa is even more problematic, as explained by body positivity activist Sharon Maxwell." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2909" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ef774fd6db9a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tessa wasn’t created using generative AI techniques, unlike AI chatbots like ChatGPT." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2942" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f038464a00ac> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "But NEDA Vice President Lauren Smolar denied the move arose from the hotline staff’s threat of unionization." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2904" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f0f2f793fefb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The activist Sharon Maxwell was advised a calorie deficit of 500-1,000 calories a day and weekly weighing to keep track of the weight." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2936" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f3f526882d7e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NEDA CEO Liz Thompson told the website that ‘Tessa’ was not meant to replace the helpline but was created as a separate programme." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2936" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f602df55ec56> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Members of the union, Helpline Associates United, say they were fired days after their union election was certified." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2902" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f726bdc23b6c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Cass founder and CEO Michiel Rauws told HuffPost that there was a 600% surge in traffic to the chatbot." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2927" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f7c2f8397298> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Psychologist and eating-disorder specialist Dr. Alexis Conason shared screenshots of Tessa advising her on how to achieve a “safe daily calorie deficit” for weight loss." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2901" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f84e8bc1b022> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Even though Tessa was built with guardrails, according to its creator Dr. Ellen Fitzsimmons-Craft of Washington University’s medical school, the promotion of disordered eating reveals the risks of automating human roles." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8242" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f876f69e24c6> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NEDA — the largest eating disorder-focused nonprofit in the US, according to Vice's initial report on the debacle — had decided to entirely disband its heavily-trafficked crisis helpline in favor of a human-less chatbot called Tessa." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2932" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/f9917abf92ce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The National Eating Disorders Association, a nonprofit supporting individuals affected by eating disorders, said it has disabled its wellness chatbot after two users reported the program gave them dieting advice that promoted disordered eating behaviors." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2914" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fb20d8858d95> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "They claim that as a result of the job layoffs, they have filed an unfair labor practice complaint with the US National Labor Relations Board." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2942" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fc99af7a2a38> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The union released a statement on Twitter about the incident on May 26. The Helpline Associates Union did not immediately respond to requests for comment." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2914" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fca729d1ae48> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "NEDA stated." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2941" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fd892f7dcc93> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The chatbot is not managed by ChatGPT and is \"not a highly functional AI system,\" according to Thompson." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2928" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/fe2ef611d36d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "On Monday, an activist named Sharon Maxwell posted on Instagram, sharing a review of her experience with Tessa." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8242" .

