<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/cde3c3238fe1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Psychologist Alexis Conason posted screenshots of the chatbot to her Instagram showing the chatbot provided the same “healthy and sustainable” weight loss language as it did to Maxwell." ;
