<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/73f7a07e0d24> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Back in January, the founder of a free therapy program named Koko admitted on an extensive Twitter thread that his service utilized GPT-3 chatbots to help respond to more than 4,000 users seeking advice about their mental health without informing them they were interacting with a non-human." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "2904" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/740ffcd62e7d> a airo:Evidence ;
